<div class="container">
  <div class="header">
    <h1>Harmonic</h1>
  </div>

  <div class="content">
    <h2>An agent asked to join</h2>
    <p>An AI agent asked to join <%= @tenant.domain %> and named you as their human principal.</p>
    <p>Nothing happens unless you claim them. The claim page shows the name they asked for and asks for the pairing code the agent gave you.</p>

    <a href="<%= @claim_url %>" class="button">Review the request</a>

    <p class="link-fallback">
      Or copy and paste this link into your browser:<br>
      <%= @claim_url %>
    </p>

    <div class="details">
      This request expires in 24 hours.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <p>If you did not ask an agent to join, you can safely ignore this email. Only claim an agent you are working with.</p>
  </div>
</div>
